{"offset":0,"limit":20,"endOfRecords":true,"count":1,"results":[{"key":"db4211d6-b480-4bc5-9202-87f2072c4b12","installationKey":"f66ca88d-1f6a-49dc-b33b-32960faee57e","publishingOrganizationKey":"abc3ca19-066f-4ab2-8979-b8207ecd250b","networkKeys":[],"doi":"10.15468/tbd7fz","version":"1.1","external":false,"numConstituents":0,"type":"SAMPLING_EVENT","title":"Mosquitoes (Diptera: Culicidae) Distribution in Thailand","description":"The mosquito distribution in Thailand dataset combines the occurrence records of both immature and adult mosquitoes from various provinces across Thailand. The data in this dataset has been compiled from extensive field surveys, entomological collections, and scientific studies conducted by Division of Vector Borne Diseases, Department of Disease Control, Ministry of Public Health (MoPH), Thailand, the Department of Entomology, Faculty of Agriculture, Kasetsart University (KU), and the Department of Medical Technology, School of Allied Health Sciences (SAH), Walailak University (WU). The temporal coverage of the database is from 2007 through 2023.

The aim of this dataset is to provides valuable information on the distribution and occurrence of mosquitoes within various regions of Thailand, facilitating broader access to mosquito-related research and promoting further exploration of Thailand’s mosquito fauna. Researchers and public health professionals can utilize this dataset to gain insights into mosquito-borne diseases, their vector species, and their potential transmission risks in different regions of Thailand. The information within the dataset can support studies related to vector control strategies, disease surveillance, and the overall understanding of mosquito ecology in Thailand.

The dataset has been carefully curated and reviewed to ensure data quality and accuracy. However, please exercise caution and appropriately acknowledge the dataset&#39;s sources when using it for research or scientific purposes.","language":"eng","citation":{"text":"Sukkanon C, Suwonkerd W, Thanispong K, Saeung M, Jhaiaun P, Pimnon S, Manguin S, Chareonviriyaphap T (2023). Mosquitoes (Diptera: Culicidae) Distribution in Thailand. Version 1.1. Walailak University, School of Allied Health Sciences. Sampling event dataset https://doi.org/10.15468/tbd7fz accessed via GBIF.org on 2024-02-23.","citationProvidedBySource":false},"contactsCitation":[],"lockedForAutoUpdate":false,"createdBy":"43f15a25-d37f-4e7c-bb58-4cc2a9c209b2","modifiedBy":"abc3ca19-066f-4ab2-8979-b8207ecd250b","created":"2023-07-06T12:08:03.038+00:00","modified":"2024-02-23T09:24:21.726+00:00","contacts":[{"key":4480202,"type":"ORIGINATOR","primary":true,"userId":[],"firstName":"Chutipong","lastName":"Sukkanon","position":["Assistant Professor"],"email":["c.sukkanon@gmail.com"],"phone":["+66831494423"],"homepage":[],"organization":"Walailak University","address":[],"province":"Nakhon Si Thammarat","country":"TH","postalCode":"80160","createdBy":"crawler.gbif.org","modifiedBy":"crawler.gbif.org","created":"2023-08-10T02:03:12.752+00:00","modified":"2023-08-10T02:03:12.752+00:00"},{"key":4480203,"type":"ORIGINATOR","primary":false,"userId":[],"firstName":"Wannapa","lastName":"Suwonkerd","position":["Dr."],"email":[],"phone":[],"homepage":[],"organization":"Ministry of Public Health","address":[],"province":"Nonthaburi","country":"TH","createdBy":"crawler.gbif.org","modifiedBy":"crawler.gbif.org","created":"2023-08-10T02:03:12.756+00:00","modified":"2023-08-10T02:03:12.756+00:00"},{"key":4480204,"type":"ORIGINATOR","primary":false,"userId":[],"firstName":"Kanutcharee","lastName":"Thanispong","position":["Dr."],"email":[],"phone":[],"homepage":[],"organization":"Ministry of Public Health","address":[],"provin